  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "style": "FieldLabel",
      "text": "FICTIONAL PLAN AND EXAMPLE"
    },
    {
      "style": "Title",
      "text": "Nature Observation Journal"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Return to one place and notice what changes"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Use this journal to describe one plant or small visible area over repeat visits. Record what you can…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "A fictional observation plan"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Subject code: Plant A — the low plant beside the courtyard bench. Species unknown; no identification…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Question: how does the visible leaf colour on the branch shown in my sketch differ across visits?"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Return plan: observe from the same bench when conditions allow. Use the sketch and a broad site code to…"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldMeta",
      "text": "01 Describe first. Separate visible details from an explanation. 02 Return carefully. Record date,…"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldNote",
      "text": "Use a familiar seated or window view if useful. Describe, sketch or dictate your notes. Adapt the visit…"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldNote",
      "text": "Original conceptual botanical ornament. It does not depict or identify the observation subject."
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldNote",
      "text": "Personal observation practice. No actual field records, species identifications or environmental…"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldLabel",
      "text": "FICTIONAL PLAN AND EXAMPLE"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "First visit"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldLead",
      "text": "Describe the subject before interpreting it"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Use a subject code you can recognise next time. Note visible shape, edge, colour, position or number.…"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldMeta",
      "text": "Subject code: ____________________ Observer: ____________________ Date and time: __________________…"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldNote",
      "text": "For each feature, write observed, uncertain or not checked. If you looked but did not see it, record…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Sketch or describe one detail"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldNote",
      "text": "Label the view and any measured scale. A quick shape and a few words are enough."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "What I observed and what I wonder"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldNote",
      "text": "Keep the observation separate from the question or explanation."
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldNote",
      "text": "Before leaving, note one feature you want to compare on the repeat visit. Observe without picking,…"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldLabel",
      "text": "FICTIONAL PLAN AND EXAMPLE"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Repeat visit"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldLead",
      "text": "Use the same viewpoint and the same fields"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Find the same subject using your earlier sketch and site code. Record the conditions again. If the…"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldMeta",
      "text": "Subject code: ____________________ Observer: ____________________ Date and time: __________________…"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldNote",
      "text": "For each feature, write observed, uncertain or not checked. Record what is visible now before reading…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Sketch or describe the same detail"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldNote",
      "text": "Keep the view and any measured scale comparable. Label any difference in method."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "What stayed similar and what differed"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldNote",
      "text": "Cite a detail from each visit. Leave the cause open unless you have evidence."
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldNote",
      "text": "Use another copy of the visit sheet for later dates or seasons. Record your own local season; do not…"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldLabel",
      "text": "FICTIONAL PLAN AND EXAMPLE"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Compare across visits"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldLead",
      "text": "A small record can guide the next question"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Use one row per visit. Copy only details you actually recorded, including uncertainty. Compare the same…"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldNote",
      "text": "Actual comparison log — complete after observing"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Fictional example of careful wording"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldNote",
      "text": "On one visit, Plant A had three yellow leaves on the visible branch; on the next, five were visible.…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "What the records support"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldNote",
      "text": "Name one difference or similarity, the entries that support it, and a limit of the comparison. If you…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "What I will look for next"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldLabel",
      "text": "FICTIONAL PLAN AND EXAMPLE"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Keep identification separate"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldLead",
      "text": "A description can be useful while the name is unknown"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Keep the subject code stable. A tentative species name is a suggestion to check, not a conclusion.…"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldMeta",
      "text": "Subject code: ____________________ Descriptive label while unknown: __________________________________…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Identification source and limits"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldNote",
      "text": "Record title or person, date consulted, relevant features and unresolved doubt. Do not infer an…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Plan the next visit"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldNote",
      "text": "When or under what conditions will I return? Which feature will I check? What would make the visits…"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldNote",
      "text": "Use a broad site code in shared copies; omit a private address or sensitive location. Stay in places…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Method reference"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldNote",
      "text": "USA National Phenology Network guidance supports keeping observations while identification is uncertain…"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldNote",
      "text": "USA National Phenology Network — observation guidance"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldNote",
      "text": "Original journal and AI-generated conceptual ornament by Studio Templates. No real observation or…"
    }
  ],
